{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41523","headline":"寄庐山白上人 · 左偃","name":"寄庐山白上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"潦倒门前客，闲眠岁又残。\n连天数峰雪，终日与谁看。\n万丈高松古，千寻落水寒。\n仍闻有新作，嬾寄入长安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"左偃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41523.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41523","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}